# ساخت فایل Celery

فایل:

```text id="c14"
MyProject/config/celery.py
```

---

```python id="c15"
from celery import Celery

app = Celery(
    "config"
)

app.config_from_object(
    "django.conf:settings",
    namespace="CELERY"
)

app.autodiscover_tasks()
```

